Q: EndpointConnectionFailedEvent not getting caught by Couchbase Circuit Breaker A: <p><a href="https://github.com/couchbase/couchbase-jvm-clients/blob/36fc432e9602093ac7ba7f6e7772981c62078158/core-io/src/main/java/com/couchbase/client/core/endpoint/BaseEndpoint.java#L650" rel="nofollow noreferrer">The code that invokes the circuit breaker callback</a> is only executed <a href="https://github.com/couchbase/couchbase-jvm-clients/blob/36fc432e9602093ac7ba7f6e7772981c62078158/core-io/src/main/java/com/couchbase/client/core/endpoint/BaseEndpoint.java#L638" rel="nofollow noreferrer">if the endpoint is writable</a> (is connected, has room in write buffer, and circuit breaker isn't already tripped).</p>
<p>If the endpoint is not writable, the <code>RetryStrategy</code> determines whether the request is retried.</p>
<p>Here's a custom retry strategy that does not retry if the node or endpoint is unavailable, and delegates to the default &quot;best effort&quot; strategy for all other reasons:</p>
<pre><code>RetryStrategy customStrategy = new BestEffortRetryStrategy() {
  @Override
  public CompletableFuture&lt;RetryAction&gt; shouldRetry(
    Request&lt;? extends Response&gt; request,
    RetryReason reason
  ) {
    switch (reason) {
      case NODE_NOT_AVAILABLE:
      case ENDPOINT_NOT_AVAILABLE:
        return CompletableFuture.completedFuture(RetryAction.noRetry());
      default:
        return super.shouldRetry(request, reason);
    }
  }
};
</code></pre>
<p>You can make this your default strategy when connecting to the cluster:</p>
<pre><code>Cluster cluster = Cluster.connect(
  &quot;couchbase://example.com&quot;,
  ClusterOptions.clusterOptions(&quot;username&quot;, &quot;password&quot;)
    .environment(env -&gt; env
      .retryStrategy(customStrategy)
    )
);
</code></pre>
<p>Or you can override the default strategy for a specific request:</p>
<pre><code>GetResult result = collection.get(
  &quot;my-document-id&quot;,
  GetOptions.getOptions().retryStrategy(customStrategy)
);
</code></pre>
<p>Reference: <a href="https://docs.couchbase.com/java-sdk/current/howtos/error-handling.html#customizing-the-retrystrategy" rel="nofollow noreferrer">Customizing the Retry Strategy</a></p>
